{"id":2147000241,"properties":{"title":"Schönbielhütte SAC","abstract":null,"description":"The Matterhorn north face is the dominating element on the way to the cabin, in summer as well as winter. Surrounded by majestic four-thousanders, the cabin is the starting point of high alpine tours such as the Valais Haute Route. But the hut in the Zmutt valley is also a hiking destination from Zermatt.","r_number":2147000241,"city":"Valais","place":"Valais","tel":"+41 27 967 13 54","email":"bielti.zermatt@gmx.ch","url1_link":"https://haus-bielti.ch/schoenbielhuette/","photo_gallery_big":["https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1752138266_1497923650.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1528799676_1429908326.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1548335576_1174259421.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1528799676_591263336.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1528799676_1517586475.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1548335577_1057012850.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1548335576_1517819350.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1548335576_1036309818.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1548335577_1576931622.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1528799676_2111460488.jpg","https://static.www.suissealpine.sac-cas.ch/1528799678_1127007747.jpg"]},"geometry":{"coordinates":[46.00198405758488,7.6290323610628565]}}